    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "**Needs** is what a block reads from the shared state, which a block above it must make. **Makes** is what it writes there for blocks below. What a block may hold, indented under it, is at the end of its description.",
      "id": "9cb5ae42e124773a"
