m:1px solid #ddd\">—</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">FROM</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Fetch a page for the blocks indented below. Holds blocks, and must.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes 🏘 page</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">NEIGHBORS</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Retrieve available neighborhood sitemaps. Holds lines of data.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes 🏘 neighborhood</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">WALK</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Explore the neighborhood link graph.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🏘 neighborhood · makes 🔗 aspect</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">RANDOM</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Select a random page from the neighbors.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🏘 neighborhood · makes 🏘 info</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">ROSTER</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Make a Roster for the current neighborhood.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🏘 neighborhood · makes ☰ items</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">LINEUP</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Make a page from the current lineup.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes ☰ items</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">SHOW</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Add an existing page to the lineup. Shows a result.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🏘 info when no page is named</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">DELTA</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Apply recent remote site changes.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🖥 actions for apply · makes 🖥 recent for have; 🏘 page for apply</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">SOURCE</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Read a data source from the lineup. May hold blocks.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes the topic named, such as 🔗 marker</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">FILE</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">User selects one of the available files. Holds blocks, and must.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 📄 assets · makes 📄 the file text, named by the suffix as typed, for the blocks inside</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">KWIC</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Construct a Keyword-In-Context index. Holds lines of data.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 📄 tsv · makes ☰ items</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">SENSOR</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Read sensor data from a named endpoint. May hold blocks.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🏘 page · makes 🌡 temperature</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">CODE</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Run JavaScript from a Code item on this page. Holds lines of data.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes ◆ whatever its function sets</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">HELLO</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Add a happy face each time run. Shows a result.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">—</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">REPORT</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Report a measurement in place in the item. Shows a result.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🌡 temperature, or the key named after REPORT</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">PREVIEW</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Display computed state as a ghost page. Shows a result.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🔗 marker for map; 🔗 aspect for graph; ☰ items for items; 🏘 page for page</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">POPUP</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Open a pop-up window with various contents. Shows a result.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🖥 commons for images</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">SOLO</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Launch the Solo plugin pop-up viewer. Shows a result.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🔗 aspect</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">PRINT</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Compose a printable story and garden. Shows a result.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🔗 aspect; 🏘 neighborhood · makes ☰ items</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">DOWNLOAD</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Download state as a file. Shows a result.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 📄 the state named by the file ending</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">GET</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Await a result from the server. Holds server blocks, and must.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes 🖥 result</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">PLUGIN</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Await a result from an installed plugin. Holds the plugin's blocks, and must.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes 🖥 result</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">LISTEN</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Wait for a specific message.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">—</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">MESSAGE</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Send a specific message.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">—</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">FORWARD</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Move the drawing \"turtle\" forward.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes ✏️ turtle</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">TURN</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Turn the drawing \"turtle\".</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes ✏️ turtle</td></tr>\n</table>",
      "id": "324cc558a4b78d5a"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## Blocks that run on the server, inside GET",
      "id": "0265b47da579d647"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Needs and makes</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">HELLO</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Add a happy face each time run.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">—</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">UPTIME</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Report time the server has run.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">—</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">SLEEP</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Suspend a sequence of blocks.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">—</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">COMMONS</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Report image files and byte count.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes 🖥 commons</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">DELTA</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Retrieve recent site changes.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">needs 🖥 recent · makes 🖥 actions</td></tr>\n</table>",
      "id": "9c80f08e3fa7532b"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "GET sends only the state named after it to the server, such as `GET recent`. Whatever the server blocks make comes back for the blocks after GET.",
      "id": "ba679e5971940eaa"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## Blocks that run inside PLUGIN rcn",
      "id": "bc7a02575122449a"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "These come with the Mech Blocks plugin and read RCN data held on the same site.",
      "id": "dc8dcb3fbea8bf56"
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "text": "<table style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr><th style=\"width:1%;white-space:nowrap;text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Block</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">What it does</th><th style=\"text-align:left;padding:4px 6px;border-bottom:2px solid #999\">Needs and makes</th></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">PROJECTIONS</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">List the Layer 1 folders on this site.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes ☰ items</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">PROJECTION</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">A Layer 1 folder's graph, as an aspect; kinds after the name keep only those.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes 🔗 aspect</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">BADGES</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">SODOTO badges on this site's pages: people and the skills they hold; words after it keep matching skills.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">makes 🔗 aspect; ☰ items</td></tr>\n<tr><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">HELLO</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">Proves the rcn plugin answers.</td><td style=\"padding:4px 6px;vertical-align:top;border-bottom:1px solid #ddd\">—</td></tr>\n</table>",
      "id": "b10f0ecdcefde6d3"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "## Notes",
      "id": "a62643fd6bb80291"
    },
    {
      "type": "markdown",
      "text": "- A block that is missing what it needs stops with a ✖︎ and makes nothing, so blocks after it that needed its result stop too.\n- FILE stores the file's text under its argument exactly as typed. `FILE tsv` makes tsv, which KWIC and DOWNLOAD can use. `FILE .tsv` stores it under \".tsv\", which they cannot find.\n- CODE runs for anyone only when it sits directly inside CLICK or TICK. Elsewhere it runs only for the page owner.\n- [[CODE]] and [[DOWNLOAD]] had no handbook pages; pages for them were drafted in October 2026.",
      "id": "6b22df058b325787"
    }
