      "item": {
        "type": "markdown",
        "id": "6b22df058b325787",
        "text": "- A block that is missing what it needs stops with a ✖︎ and makes nothing, so blocks after it that needed its result stop too.\n- FILE stores the file's text under its argument exactly as typed. `FILE tsv` makes tsv, which KWIC and DOWNLOAD can use. `FILE .tsv` stores it under \".tsv\", which they cannot find.\n- CODE runs for anyone only when it sits directly inside CLICK or TICK. Elsewhere it runs only for the page owner.\n- [[CODE]] and [[DOWNLOAD]] had no handbook pages; pages for them were drafted in October 2026."
